<title>USA: Sylvan Learning files for share offering.</title>
<headline>Sylvan Learning files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE, Md. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sylvan Learnings Systems Inc said it filed a statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of up to 4.75 million shares.</p>
<p>Of the total number of shares, the company will sell 1,464,505 shares and selling shareholders will offer 3,285,495 shares. Alex. Brown &amp; Sons is the lead manager for the offering.</p>
